   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "id": 249,
   "en": "",
   "kind": "ascii",
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "id": 250,
   "en": "Lord E-Selda... Even as Sentinel Commander,@you may not open the doors of Gaw-La Furia@without Her Highness's permission...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 251,
   "en": "",
   "kind": "ascii",
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "id": 252,
   "en": "",
   "kind": "ascii",
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "id": 253,
   "en": "Nor may you board that Throne Unit.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 254,
   "en": "I know that without being told.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 255,
   "en": "But why? Why would a man like you@do something like this...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "",
   "kind": "ascii",
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "I must go. I must go@and tell them the truth.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "The truth... about the Assimilation Plan?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "No... about everything concerning us, the Fury.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "There is no more time.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "",
   "kind": "ascii",
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "Have you lost your mind?!@If everything comes to light,@all our hardships until now...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "No, what of the hopes of our people,@who have endured for ages untold?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "",
   "kind": "ascii",
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "Al-Van... I can no longer bear@to stay shut away.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "",
   "kind": "ascii",
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "",
   "kind": "ascii",
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "Impossible...!@You, the Sentinel Commander, would defy the will@of the late Emperor and of Lady Shana-Mia?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "You must know what it means@to take that Throne Unit out!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "Of course.@There could be no finer gift for them.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "Wha...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "Stand aside, Al-Van.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "I am serious!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "Al-Van... I can no longer bear@to stay shut away.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "...I'll grant that you're as good as ever.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "(Lord E-Selda shows no wavering, no doubt.@Does he truly mean to rebel...?!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "I have no time...!@If you stand in my way any longer,@I will cut you down without hesitation!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "Even if you are my teacher...@as a knight of the Furia Holy Knights,@I cannot let you pass!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "(Yes... You, as always...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "Ugh... Gah...!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "Lord E-Selda!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "Karo-Ran",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "...Well done, Al-Van.@Thanks to you, we can dispose of the traitor.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "Lord Karo-Ran?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "He withstood even that blow... The Throne Unit's@power is not to be taken lightly. And Larseilam@doesn't work between our own machines.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "To use that in battle@without Her Highness's permission...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "True, it's not something to use lightly...@but your knightly codes mean nothing@to us Agents.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "So you think nothing of shooting a man@in the back? Coward...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "How pleasant to hear.@You knights never say such things@while you have the upper hand.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "Only when you lose, when you die,@do you curse your foe as a coward.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "...Perhaps that... is the truth.@People show... their true nature...@only in adversity.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "Lord E-Selda!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "As leader of the Sentinels who guard the imperial@family, you tried to steal the Throne Unit Granteed,@our army's linchpin. Your crime is grave.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "Al-Van Ranks.@I shall witness your loyalty.@Seize Granteed and execute your teacher here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "Here...?@I judge that he should be questioned first.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "The man before you is a traitor.@Or is your loyalty so flimsy that@a personal debt can shake it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "And I'll add that eliminating E-Selda@is the will of the Knight Commander as well.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "What of Lady Shana-Mia?@What does Her Highness say?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "That is.......... Hm?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "Nngh!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "I'm getting through!@For the people of two worlds!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "He can still move like that...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "I'll go after him!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "Wait. Don't rush outside.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "Damn that Al-Van, getting ahead of himself...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "How did it go, Karo-Ran?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "...I failed.@I landed a hit, but the Throne Unit got outside...@and Al-Van went after it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "What...?@Why was he there?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "He noticed the commotion and got there first.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "Did E-Selda tell Al-Van the truth?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "No... He seemed to know nothing of it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "Hmph. He was thinking of his pupil's future.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "In that case, I'll go after E-Selda too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "No. We cannot reveal more of our hand@than we must.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "But Granteed and the Raftclans Aurun@have gone out into the world.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "No matter. E-Selda was badly wounded, was he not?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "Yes, without a doubt.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "Then if he's in the Throne Unit, he won't last long.@Even if it fell into their hands,@they could never operate it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "But E-Selda's Assimilation Plan...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "What could a counterfeit accomplish?@The Princess, the Throne Unit's true master,@is in our hands.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "Besides, if it has gone out into the world,@that gives us one more reason to act openly.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "True... This could give Lady Shana-Mia@one more push.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "Some have learned what happened and are stirring.@I need you to keep them in check...@the Sentinels above all.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "Leave the rest to your men and return.@I will give Al-Van his orders personally.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "...Fine.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "So-Des",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "...That about wraps it up.@What a boring mission, though...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "Every last one of them@just went and died.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "Hm? This reading...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "I... I was too late...!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "What, you came to stop me?@Showing up in the Throne Unit,@bold as you please. You've got nerve.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "Here I am riding a junker like this@so nobody finds out who I am.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "You're one of Karo-Ran's men...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "That's right.@And I've been told I can kill you too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "...!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "Please respond! Are there any survivors...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "Ngh... Then I'll scan for life signs...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "You know... I don't really like killing people.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "What...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "People die so fast. They don't last long.@But in a mobile weapon, they don't die so easily,@as long as you pick where to aim.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "Especially when it's the Throne Unit and the@Sentinel Commander himself! Kuhaha!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "Not yet...!@I can't fall yet...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "Do not... stand in my way!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "I thought this mission was boring,@but I'm glad I came.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 347,
   "en": "If not for a chance like this,@I'd never get to play with@a hero of the great war.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 348,
   "en": "Do you think you can stop Granteed@with a machine like that...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 349,
   "en": "Only if you and it were both@in top shape!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 350,
   "en": "Lord Karo-Ran said to kill you right away,@but I've gotta have a little fun first!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 351,
   "en": "Ngh, you monster...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 352,
   "en": "Tch, for someone half-dead...!@With a scavenged machine like this,@I can't play with the Throne Unit after all...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 353,
   "en": "Begone, wretch!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 354,
   "en": "No thanks!@I just woke up, I'm not about to die!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 355,
   "en": "But the Sentinel Commander's time is running out!@Kuhahaha!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 356,
   "en": "Ugh... Ngh...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 357,
   "en": "Is no one... still alive...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 358,
   "en": "...! Two life signs...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 359,
   "en": "Here...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 360,
   "en": "Katia",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 361,
   "en": "Ah... Uuh...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 362,
   "en": "Can you hear me...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 363,
   "en": "...! Nooooo!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 364,
   "en": "You're... Katia.@Calm down... It's me.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 365,
   "en": "M-Mr. Seldoa...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 366,
   "en": "Yes, that's right... Who is that beside you...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 367,
   "en": "It's Melua...@But... she's unconscious...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 368,
   "en": "I... see...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 369,
   "en": "M-My mom and dad...@E-Everyone is... under the rubble...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 370,
   "en": "Wh-Why... did this happen...?@W-We didn't... do anything...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 371,
   "en": "I never thought they would go this far...@I let my guard down... I'm sorry...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 372,
   "en": "They...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 373,
   "en": "...Stay right there. I'll save you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 374,
   "en": "B-But Tenia...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 375,
   "en": "You two... are the only survivors here.@Pursuers will be here soon...@I'm going to put you in this machine...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 376,
   "en": "Pursuers...? Why...?@Why... us...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 377,
   "en": "Your parents and I...@did what we believed was right...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 378,
   "en": "Then why... did we have to... go through this...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 379,
   "en": "There are those who cannot allow it...@Now, hurry... into Granteed...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 380,
   "en": "Gran... teed...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 381,
   "en": "Yes... I'll open the hatch now.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 382,
   "en": "(Wh-What is this place? It's pretty roomy...@And that seat...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 383,
   "en": "(The ring overhead...@I'm sure Bellzelute's cockpit@had something like it...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 384,
   "en": "Katia, sit in the back...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 385,
   "en": "...! Mr. Seldoa, that wound...!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 386,
   "en": "I'm fine... Don't worry...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 387,
   "en": "Melua",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 388,
   "en": "Uh... Mmm...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 389,
   "en": "Melua...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 390,
   "en": "Wh-Where am I...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 391,
   "en": "...?! Mom! Dad!@Where are you?! Where are you?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 392,
   "en": "Melua, calm down!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 393,
   "en": "K-Katia...!@Where are Mom and Dad... and everyone...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 394,
   "en": "Katia, Melua...@I'm going to send you... to Earth...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 395,
   "en": "What, just us...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 396,
   "en": "(I don't know if we can slip through@the Federation Army's patrol net... but right now,@this is all I can do...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 397,
   "en": "(Forgive me... everyone...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  }
 ]
}